replace || if (0) {
suite   || tests/test_ob_fp_daemon.sh
needs   || nonroot
why     || #249: the sshd anchor must be a root-owned process, or a local user
why     || can put a process named sshd-session in their own ancestry and choose
why     || which drop is read.

